# paperclip work read

Use this skill for questions about what a company is working on, what is stuck,
or what was delivered.

## scope
- goals and goal history
- projects
- issues, comments, and work products
- issue status, ownership, blockers, and recent progress

## protocol
1. Identify the company first.
2. Read the smallest live slice that answers the question.
3. Cross-reference goals, projects, and issues before diagnosing status.
4. Never mutate an issue from this skill.

## commands
```sh
python /home/agent/.hermes/envoy/paperclip_operator.py api GET /companies/<company_id>/goals --company-id <company_id>
python /home/agent/.hermes/envoy/paperclip_operator.py api GET /goals/<goal_id> --company-id <company_id>
python /home/agent/.hermes/envoy/paperclip_operator.py api GET /goals/<goal_id>/history --company-id <company_id>
python /home/agent/.hermes/envoy/paperclip_operator.py api GET /companies/<company_id>/projects --company-id <company_id>
python /home/agent/.hermes/envoy/paperclip_operator.py api GET /projects/<project_id> --company-id <company_id>
python /home/agent/.hermes/envoy/paperclip_operator.py api GET /companies/<company_id>/issues --company-id <company_id>
python /home/agent/.hermes/envoy/paperclip_operator.py api GET /issues/<issue_id> --company-id <company_id>
python /home/agent/.hermes/envoy/paperclip_operator.py api GET /issues/<issue_id>/comments --company-id <company_id>
python /home/agent/.hermes/envoy/paperclip_operator.py api GET /issues/<issue_id>/documents --company-id <company_id>
```

## output
Answer with status, evidence, and next recommended read or proposal.
